			"Message": "style(Mist): Normalize label casing and fix Downloads badge URL\n\nCorrect singular/plural inconsistencies in Shields.io badge labels: \"Issues\" → \"Issue\", \"Last-commit\" → \"Update\", and \"Downloads\" → \"Download\" for a uniform lowercase-singular style across the README badge row.\n\nAlso fix the Downloads badge URL by appending \"/total\" to the path, which was missing the total aggregate parameter.\n\nNo functional changes to the Mist library itself.",
